WEBVTT

01:01.600 --> 01:06.060
<i><b>Apocalypse Forever</b></i>

01:21.290 --> 01:22.270
<b>inconceivable...</b>

01:25.210 --> 01:28.210
<b>To think that Lucius would
be killed by the likes of him...</b>

01:28.920 --> 01:32.170
<b>The Daywalker cannot be
underestimated.</b>

01:32.170 --> 01:35.800
<b>Blade, and all others who defy us,
should be eliminated immediately!</b>

01:36.760 --> 01:38.050
<b>Compose yourself.</b>

01:39.220 --> 01:43.770
<b>We nobles are the chosen ones,
born with the true bloodline.</b>

01:43.770 --> 01:47.310
<b>We need not concern ourselves with
the insolent activities of the turned.</b>

01:47.310 --> 01:51.440
<b>We'll allow Blade and Deacon Frost
to continue their conflict.</b>

01:51.440 --> 01:55.690
<b>Dealing with them both once they've exhausted
each other should be a simple matter.</b>

01:56.820 --> 02:00.370
<b>Alternately, if they succeed in killing each other,
it'd be a literal case of two birds with one stone.</b>

02:00.370 --> 02:01.070
<b>No!</b>

02:01.700 --> 02:05.000
<b>Potential threats should be
dealt with as quickly as possible.</b>

02:05.000 --> 02:12.090
<b>Both Frost's organization, Existence,
and Blade pose a threat to us as matters stand.</b>

02:12.880 --> 02:16.010
<b>You are severely overestimating them.</b>

02:16.010 --> 02:19.970
<b>That motley group is
no threat to us purebloods.</b>

02:19.970 --> 02:24.220
<b>Your entire method of thinking shows
how little your grasp the danger!</b>

02:24.220 --> 02:26.230
<b>Watch your tone!</b>

02:26.230 --> 02:28.100
<b>You dare insult us!?</b>

02:29.940 --> 02:32.270
<b>Could you please open your eyes
and see the reality of the situation!?</b>

02:34.190 --> 02:37.820
<b>Has living danger-free for 400 years
made your brain rot?</b>

02:39.240 --> 02:41.620
<b>I believe this is a textbook
example of "senility."</b>

02:41.620 --> 02:42.660
<b>Silence!</b>

02:43.580 --> 02:46.910
<b>What does a two hundred year old
whelp understand?</b>

02:47.660 --> 02:49.670
<b>What did you say?</b>

02:49.670 --> 02:51.040
<b>Order!</b>

02:52.130 --> 02:55.960
<b>It's as it was written in
Lucius Isaac's final report.</b>

02:55.960 --> 02:59.130
<b>If Existence is preparing
to wage war on us,</b>

02:59.130 --> 03:03.550
<b>they should be dealt with before
they can take real action.</b>

03:04.140 --> 03:08.560
<b>However, we purebloods have
survived for millennia,</b>

03:08.560 --> 03:13.360
<b>ruling over the assorted clans,
as true monarchs of the night.</b>

03:14.060 --> 03:17.280
<b>We will live for eternity...</b>

03:17.280 --> 03:19.720
<b>that fact will not change.</b>

03:21.160 --> 03:24.370
<b>It will not be allowed to change.</b>

03:31.540 --> 03:32.460
<b>I'm heading out.</b>

03:33.170 --> 03:34.000
<b>Be careful.</b>

03:38.380 --> 03:39.130
<b>Daddy...</b>

03:40.260 --> 03:41.740
<b>where are you going?</b>

03:44.510 --> 03:45.220
<b>Alice...</b>

03:47.560 --> 03:48.740
<b>don't worry about me.</b>

03:49.390 --> 03:50.940
<b>I'll be home soon.</b>

04:22.970 --> 04:23.760
<b>Shit...</b>

04:33.980 --> 04:35.190
<b><i>This has to be...</i></b>

04:37.060 --> 04:41.280
<i>Northwestern Vietnam</i>

04:45.410 --> 04:48.620
<b>Looks like Logan's info was right,</b>

04:48.620 --> 04:52.160
<b>but I didn't expect we'd
end up being hunted.</b>

04:57.420 --> 04:58.500
<b>We need to split up.</b>

04:58.840 --> 04:59.210
<b>What?</b>

05:00.380 --> 05:01.800
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

05:07.470 --> 05:09.050
<b>It's just a scratch!</b>

05:09.050 --> 05:10.680
<b>I'm still good to go.</b>

05:13.100 --> 05:15.640
<b>I'll keep the ninjas that
are after us busy.</b>

05:18.230 --> 05:21.480
<b>You can't fight them now.</b>

05:22.570 --> 05:24.860
<b>You're hurt too!</b>

05:25.780 --> 05:27.660
<b>I'll be healed by tomorrow.</b>

05:28.570 --> 05:29.660
<b>You won't.</b>

05:30.950 --> 05:32.450
<b>Razor, look after her.</b>

05:33.700 --> 05:35.660
<b>So, I'm slowing you down?</b>

05:39.840 --> 05:44.260
<b>Well, excuse me for not being
a reliable partner...</b>

05:49.430 --> 05:55.390
<b>I guess if I stick around I'm gonna
be putting you at risk.</b>

06:07.450 --> 06:09.410
<b>Come on, Razor.</b>

06:12.740 --> 06:13.330
<b>Wait.</b>

06:25.760 --> 06:27.880
<b>Isn't this yours!?</b>

06:28.590 --> 06:31.350
<b>You hold onto that until you're healed.</b>

06:33.560 --> 06:37.230
<b>If you stay with me,
you might get hurt again.</b>

06:41.860 --> 06:45.030
<b>We're better off acting
independently until you're healed.</b>

06:48.650 --> 06:51.990
<b>Dumbass,
why didn't you just say that?</b>

06:54.790 --> 06:56.180
<b>Got it.</b>

06:56.620 --> 06:59.210
<b>I'll return this next time we meet.</b>

07:00.420 --> 07:01.750
<b>It's important to you, right?</b>

07:03.710 --> 07:06.340
<b>I'll see you then, partner.</b>

07:13.510 --> 07:15.390
<b>They're getting closer...</b>

07:15.390 --> 07:16.060
<b>you better hurry.</b>

08:29.090 --> 08:30.130
<b>Eric...!</b>

08:45.230 --> 08:46.270
<b>You awake?</b>

08:52.190 --> 08:53.400
<b>Don't glare at me.</b>

08:54.030 --> 08:56.870
<b>I rescued you when you were
out cold in the jungle.</b>

08:58.280 --> 08:59.990
<b>This is a good sword.</b>

08:59.990 --> 09:02.080
<b>You've really taken care of it.</b>

09:03.870 --> 09:06.540
<b>I saw you fighting out there.</b>

09:07.000 --> 09:09.920
<b>You're the vampire hunter,
Blade, right?</b>

09:12.460 --> 09:13.720
<b>What do you want with me?</b>

09:15.130 --> 09:16.550
<b>I guess that's a "yes."</b>

09:17.760 --> 09:20.680
<b>I'm not ready to decide
what to do with you, yet...</b>

09:21.680 --> 09:24.940
<b>You're not part of Existence?</b>

09:25.770 --> 09:29.150
<b>They've actually been hounding me to
the point that I'm fed up with them.</b>

09:31.360 --> 09:32.880
<b>Is this a silver stake?</b>

09:33.610 --> 09:36.610
<b>Not the kind of thing a vampire like you
is normally interested in.</b>

09:40.830 --> 09:42.160
<b>You noticed?</b>

09:45.620 --> 09:46.580
<b>But...</b>

09:51.040 --> 09:53.050
<b>It's not like I wanted to become one.</b>

09:57.010 --> 09:58.180
<b>I'm Stan.</b>

09:58.930 --> 10:01.660
<b>I was in the U.S. Army.</b>

10:02.760 --> 10:05.600
<b>I ended up here during the Vietnam war.</b>

10:08.100 --> 10:10.420
<b>You ever hear of "Project V?"</b>

10:11.730 --> 10:12.690
<b>I haven't.</b>

10:13.400 --> 10:15.030
<b>Yeah, probably not...</b>

10:15.530 --> 10:17.240
<b>It's a long story.</b>

10:17.240 --> 10:22.240
<b>But, I think the Daywalker should know
about what happened to us.</b>

10:22.240 --> 10:23.040
<b>Us?</b>

10:24.290 --> 10:25.080
<b>Yeah.</b>

10:25.830 --> 10:28.870
<b>I was in a special forces unit
when I came here.</b>

10:29.880 --> 10:36.630
<b>One day, an officer came by with a proposition
for a secret operation...</b>

10:33.130 --> 10:37.170
Saigon

10:38.590 --> 10:40.760
<b>I was so young then...</b>

10:40.760 --> 10:44.810
<b>I thought winning the war
would bring about world peace,</b>

10:44.810 --> 10:47.480
<b>and I was prepared to do anything
in service of my country.</b>

10:49.310 --> 10:51.100
<b>It was called Project V.</b>

10:52.150 --> 10:58.240
<b>The military and CIA would administer a drug from
an organization called A.I.M. to a group of soldiers,</b>

10:58.240 --> 11:02.910
<b>and create a squad of super soldiers to
turn the war around, believe it or not.</b>

11:04.200 --> 11:08.290
<b>And that "drug" was vampire blood.</b>

11:08.870 --> 11:16.050
<b>To top it off, a mind-control chip was implanted
in our brains to prevent us from defying orders.</b>

11:17.260 --> 11:21.340
<b>As you can probably imagine, a squad of vampires
turned out to be a pretty impressive sight.</b>

11:22.260 --> 11:25.220
<b>But it was over before we knew it...</b>

11:26.390 --> 11:29.480
<b>Our operating headquarters
was hit in a bombing and destroyed.</b>

11:30.640 --> 11:33.270
<b>And once we regained our senses,</b>

11:33.270 --> 11:36.190
<b>to make sure we wouldn't
be manipulated again,</b>

11:36.780 --> 11:42.240
<b>we carved the mind-control chips out of our
own heads before returning to base.</b>

11:44.620 --> 11:48.620
<b>But all the evidence of
the project was destroyed...</b>

11:48.620 --> 11:51.580
<b>all the officers were gone already, too.</b>

11:52.500 --> 11:56.040
<b>We were declared KIA.</b>

11:58.260 --> 12:05.350
<b>The only information we were able to confirm was
how many people we had killed and drank from.</b>

12:06.390 --> 12:10.140
<b>And when we realized we
wouldn't be able to go home...</b>

12:10.140 --> 12:11.180
<b>we became distraught.</b>

12:13.520 --> 12:16.310
<b>After a while, my squad mates grew
to curse their own existence...</b>

12:17.650 --> 12:22.110
<b>and one by one,
they walked into the daylight.</b>

12:27.990 --> 12:31.000
<b>I'm the only surviving member of
the vampire squadron.</b>

12:32.960 --> 12:34.040
<b>Should I live?</b>

12:34.710 --> 12:35.670
<b>I still don't know the answer.</b>

12:36.500 --> 12:38.340
<b>I still don't know the answer.</b>

12:56.230 --> 12:57.860
<b>The blood thirst...</b>

13:04.400 --> 13:06.510
<b>It's pathetic...</b>

13:07.070 --> 13:13.000
<b>For now, I've been able to survive by stealing
blood packs from a nearby town.</b>

13:15.290 --> 13:21.170
<b>Deacon Frost is trying to gather vampires
from all over Asia to form an army.</b>

13:22.210 --> 13:25.180
<b>He probably wants you in his collection.</b>

13:26.510 --> 13:29.100
<b>I'm not going to become a tool again...</b>

13:30.600 --> 13:33.640
<b>But what happens if
the thirst catches you,</b>

13:33.640 --> 13:35.600
<b>and you attack another human?</b>

13:39.190 --> 13:40.230
<b>I was in the same position.</b>

13:43.780 --> 13:46.610
<b>But I won't let that happen again.</b>

13:47.780 --> 13:50.430
<b>That's why I live the way I do now.</b>

13:52.040 --> 13:56.040
<b>I guess that's the difference between
a Daywalker and a vampire...</b>

14:07.760 --> 14:09.430
<b>What are you trying to do?</b>

14:09.430 --> 14:14.220
<b>I think I lived this long to run
into someone like you.</b>

14:15.810 --> 14:16.940
<b>I'm a vampire.</b>

14:17.890 --> 14:19.400
<b>Go ahead and kill me if you want.</b>

14:26.990 --> 14:32.120
<b>Once I'm dead, the last subject of
Project V will be disposed of.</b>

14:33.490 --> 14:34.740
<b>But Blade...</b>

14:35.330 --> 14:37.580
<b>I've got one last request.</b>

14:39.080 --> 14:39.670
<b>Let's hear it.</b>

15:11.410 --> 15:12.570
<b>Stand down.</b>

15:12.570 --> 15:14.990
<b>None of you stand
a chance against him.</b>

15:15.490 --> 15:16.330
<b>Eric...</b>

15:16.950 --> 15:17.700
<b>No...</b>

15:18.960 --> 15:21.900
<b>I suppose you're now Blade,
the vampire hunter.</b>

15:22.830 --> 15:24.420
<b>Mikage Kikyo.</b>

15:24.960 --> 15:28.210
<b>Why are you working for Existence?</b>

15:28.210 --> 15:29.720
<b>They simply hired me.</b>

15:30.630 --> 15:33.550
<b>Thanks to that,
I was able to run into you again.</b>

15:34.010 --> 15:35.310
<b>Who is he?</b>

15:35.310 --> 15:36.810
<b>A classmate.</b>

15:36.810 --> 15:39.270
<b>We were taught by
the same swordmaster.</b>

15:41.020 --> 15:42.690
<b>I have business with Sargent Stan.</b>

15:43.230 --> 15:47.780
<b>I am Mikage Kikyo,
and I have a message from Deacon Frost.</b>

15:48.360 --> 15:51.450
<b>He would like you to join Existence.</b>

15:52.070 --> 15:55.580
<b>I am to bring you to him,
at any cost.</b>

15:56.160 --> 15:57.490
<b>I refuse!</b>

15:57.490 --> 16:00.330
<b>I've got friends I need to look after!</b>

16:00.960 --> 16:02.790
<b>What nonsense.</b>

16:02.790 --> 16:03.380
<b>What!?</b>

16:03.920 --> 16:07.380
<b>A dead vampire becomes dust,
not needing a grave.</b>

16:07.380 --> 16:12.800
<b>How long do you intend to skulk
around the jungle, wasting your life?</b>

16:13.510 --> 16:18.720
<b>I suppose your intentions are somewhat noble,
but otherwise completely unfathomable.</b>

16:18.720 --> 16:19.930
<b>I don't care.</b>

16:20.390 --> 16:21.480
<b>Just get out of here.</b>

16:22.730 --> 16:24.230
<b>You leave me no choice then...</b>

16:25.860 --> 16:28.190
<b>I was told to kill you if you refused.</b>

16:34.200 --> 16:36.780
<b>I suppose it's a waste of time
to tell you to stand aside?</b>

16:37.160 --> 16:39.290
<b>I'm not helping him.</b>

16:39.700 --> 16:46.250
<b>But if you're working for Deacon Frost,
Kikyo, I'll kill you no matter the reason.</b>

16:47.920 --> 16:49.590
<b>But can you strike me down?</b>

16:49.590 --> 16:52.340
<b>I've been waiting for this moment.</b>

16:52.340 --> 16:55.840
<b>Which of us has made better use of
the Yagyu skills that he has inherited?</b>

16:57.300 --> 16:58.890
<b>En garde!</b>

17:39.930 --> 17:41.600
<b>A healing factor...</b>

17:41.890 --> 17:46.600
<b>You and Logan both have
one hell of a mutant power.</b>

17:48.100 --> 17:48.980
<b>Logan...</b>

17:49.730 --> 17:51.020
<b>I remember him.</b>

18:08.210 --> 18:10.480
<b>I have to fulfill my contract first.</b>

18:11.340 --> 18:13.670
<b>You and I can duel at our
leisure some other time.</b>

18:15.170 --> 18:15.970
<b>Hold it!</b>

18:51.840 --> 18:53.500
<b>I told you, didn't I?</b>

18:53.500 --> 18:55.090
<b>I'm to kill you if you refuse.</b>

19:29.410 --> 19:30.120
<b>Impossible!</b>

19:47.140 --> 19:48.430
<b>Blade...</b>

19:57.980 --> 19:59.440
<b>Take my brothers...</b>

20:00.450 --> 20:01.910
<b>home.</b>

20:07.790 --> 20:08.580
<b>Understood.</b>

20:11.250 --> 20:15.500
<b>Thank... you...</b>

20:22.130 --> 20:23.050
<b>Alice.</b>

20:25.220 --> 20:26.100
<b>It's Daddy!</b>

20:26.850 --> 20:27.310
<b>Huh?</b>

20:29.140 --> 20:30.680
<b>Welcome home, Daddy.</b>

20:33.100 --> 20:34.560
<b>Are you crying?</b>

20:38.440 --> 20:39.440
<b>Honey!</b>

20:41.150 --> 20:42.320
<b>Welcome home.</b>

20:45.660 --> 20:47.030
<b>It's good to be home.</b>

20:56.670 --> 21:01.710
<b>Having lived for so long, without having
to worry about the pain of dying...</b>

21:02.510 --> 21:03.840
<b>you're just like them.</b>

21:09.470 --> 21:12.930
<b>I simply seek to fight opponents who
can give me a meaningful challenge.</b>

21:14.140 --> 21:16.600
<b>I've been searching for you
for a long time.</b>

21:18.820 --> 21:21.110
<b>Let us put an end to our grudge.</b>

21:22.400 --> 21:22.780
<b>Bring it on!</b>

23:03.920 --> 23:08.880
<b>Each stroke of your sword
makes my heart beat faster...</b>

23:09.590 --> 23:14.260
<b>I'm gonna put an end to that screwed
up dedication to fighting of yours.</b>

23:15.850 --> 23:18.430
<b>Listen, both of you.</b>

23:18.430 --> 23:20.140
<b>You must strengthen your hearts.</b>

23:20.940 --> 23:22.900
<b>You must always consider
the nature of the sword,</b>

23:22.900 --> 23:26.030
<b>and through that you will know
the meaning of true battle.</b>

23:26.230 --> 23:31.070
<i><b>Students and Master</b></i>

23:26.980 --> 23:30.030
<b>Next time on Blade: Students and Master</b>
